      "private": false,
      "reactions": {
        "like": 11
      },
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "It would be much better if Imposters will be avatars that are 25 meters away from you, and the crystals in 100 meters away. It will make so much more sense. Especially for VR users. You won't really notice how the avatar will change from the original to imposters in 25 meters. And about the crystals, I doubt someone will care to look at someone's avatar that is over 100 meters away from you.\n\nOr an even better solution: Make a few stages of the imposters.\n\n1. The normal high quality avatar. [0-25 meters]\n\n2. The normal imposters. [25-50 meters]\n\n3. A little bit worse imposters. [50-100 meters]\n\n4. Bad imposters. [100-250 meters]\n\n5. Crystals. [250-infinite meters]\n\nIn my opinion, it's the PERFECT avatar LOD. And if they won't be considerate about adding, at the very least the suggestion Nicalay2 gave, (like they usually do.) then that sucks.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
