      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I'd like this feature, or at least to have culled avatars be more visible, those semi-transparent prisms are barely visible, and that results in areas with lots of people seeming empty until you approach and they pop-in.\n\nI'd personally not mind static imposters floating about without animations beyond the culling range.\n\nFun note: Apparently, the game Runescape Dragon Wilds does something like this, with distant players being rendered as the OG Runescape avatars.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
